    tip: "Best paired with fluffy puri, crispy jalebi, and chunda (sweet raw mango pickle). Visit Sasuma or Kansar for the most authentic and consistently excellent undhiyo. Avoid ordering off-season — fresh seasonal vegetables are essential.",
