    time: "8:00 AM – 9:00 PM",
    tip: "Purchase freshly made farsan (the morning batch) for the best flavour and crunch. The golden window is 9–11 AM when shops just finish frying. Mix different varieties in one box for a comprehensive tasting experience. Farsan makes an excellent gift to take home.",
